# Portal host map (PORTALVIC)

Use these origins when minting links, emails, WhatsApp, redirects, or env defaults. Do not send staff to the family site or parents to the staff app.

| Surface | Origin / URL |
|---------|----------------|
| **Staff** (login, dashboard, onboarding hub, timesheet, staff flows) | `https://clubsensational-staff.vercel.app` |
| **Admin / CEO / office** | `https://portalvic.vercel.app` |
| **Parent portal** | `https://www.clubsensational.org/parent` |
| **Booking portal** | `https://www.clubsensational.org/bookingportal` |

## Do not confuse

- `PORTAL_PUBLIC_ORIGIN` / family site (`www.clubsensational.org`) is for **parents and booking**, not staff login or onboarding invites.
- Staff onboarding invite emails must use **clubsensational-staff** (`login.html` + `onboarding_portal.html`), never `www.clubsensational.org` or portalvic for the hire’s day-to-day login.
- Admin deep links (admin_dashboard, ceo_dashboard, office) stay on **portalvic**; the staff app may redirect those paths there.

## When unsure

- New hire / Support Worker / instructor email → staff host
- Sessions Overview / HR / payments admin → portalvic
- Parent hub / finish-booking / invoices for families → clubsensational.org `/parent`
- Places / booking offer for families → clubsensational.org `/bookingportal`
